WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.768
I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.170
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.738
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:08.508
President Biden returned
to the White House this morning

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.411
after spending the weekend at
his beach house in Delaware.

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:13.846
Things must be pretty rough
in Washington

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:16.482
if you think to yourself,
"You know what would be great?

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:18.351
The beach in November."

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:19.519
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:22.054
According to a new pool,
61% of voters approve

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:24.257
of the bipartisan
infrastructure bill,

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:27.593
at least until Biden signs it.

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.362
Former President Barack Obama

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.897
spoke today at the U.N.
climate summit in Scotland

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:34.700
where he warned that
without immediate action

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.402
global temperatures could rise

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:39.105
by as much as two more buttons.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:42.241
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:44.110
The "Sesame Street" character
Big Bird

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:46.179
announced over the weekend
on social media

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:48.281
that he received
his coronavirus vaccine shot.

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.750
"We'll take him!"
said the Packers.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.785
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:54.787
That's good. Good graphic.

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:57.357
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:59.291
It's a good Photoshop.
You wait all day.

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.294
I don't see 'em --
I see 'em when you see 'em.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.529
And I'm pretty happy about it.
You know?

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:06.299
According to a new report,
President Biden farted

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:10.136
while speaking to Britain's
Duchess Camilla Parker Bowles

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:13.373
at the U.N. climate summit,
which brings us to a segment

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.742
called, "How Is There
Not Video of This?!"

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:22.015
How's there not video of this?

00:01:22.015 --> 00:01:24.249
Do you know what kind of
currency that clip would be

00:01:24.249 --> 00:01:25.851
for monologue writers?

00:01:25.851 --> 00:01:27.820
Think of how many times you've
seen his falling up the stairs.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.223
Now imagine if instead of
falling up the stairs

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:32.992
he was tearin' ass
in front of a royal?

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.460
How's there not video of this?

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.696
I'd rather not even know
what happened...

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:39.164
than know what happened,
but I'll never see it.

00:01:39.164 --> 00:01:41.533
Be like if you just heard about

00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:43.369
that news reporter
stomping grapes.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.238
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:47.040
Well.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.975
Maybe that'll cheer me up.
Can we just show that?

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:52.344
-Oh. Oh!

00:01:52.344 --> 00:01:54.914
Oh! Ogh-ogh-ogh-ogh!

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:57.550
-Yeah.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.285
Yeah, that helped.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:02.588
-This has been "How Is There
Not Video of This?!"

00:02:02.588 --> 00:02:03.922
-That's right.

00:02:03.922 --> 00:02:05.925
Apparently, Britain's
Duchess Camilla Parker Bowles

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.560
hasn't been able
to stop talking about

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.330
how President Biden let out
a loud, long fart

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:14.000
when they spoke at last week's
U.N. climate summit.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.770
To be fair, he warned her that
he was about to cut methane gas.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.638
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.638 --> 00:02:22.141
Does that mean that's wor--
that she --

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:23.943
I just would have thought

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:28.514
a duchess would have
a different word than "fart."

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:30.883
Learn a new thing every day.

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:33.152
A couple in New Zealand
recently grew a potato

00:02:33.152 --> 00:02:36.289
that was about 17 pounds
and named it Doug.

00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:38.324
It's what many in New Zealand

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:40.326
are calling
"our top story tonight."

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.562
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:44.930
Several inmates
at an Oklahoma jail

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.033
recently filed a federal lawsuit
that claims

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:49.068
they had been tortured
by being forced to listen

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:51.737
to the song "Baby Shark"
on repeat for hours.

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:54.039
So if you're wondering
whether we need prison reform,

00:02:54.039 --> 00:02:55.274
I'd say we definitely...

00:02:55.274 --> 00:02:57.209
♪ Do, do, do,
do-do-do-do-do-do ♪

00:02:57.209 --> 00:02:58.678
♪ Do, do, do ♪

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:01.013
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.013 --> 00:03:04.050
Finally, today was
celebrity chef Gordon Ramsey's

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.251
55th birthday.

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.253
He spent the day
exactly the way he wanted to --

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:10.089
screaming at the person
who baked his cake!

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:12.225
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

